   "widgets_values": [
    "## H3 Video Upsampler (file to file)\n\nThe same re-draw as the IMAGE workflow, for clips of any length on any machine: the video is read, encoded, re-drawn, decoded and saved **a chunk at a time**, so RAM stays flat however long the film is (the IMAGE path holds the whole clip twice; a minute at 48 fps is over 100 GB).\n\n1. **Load Video**: pick the clip. Frame rate and soundtrack come from the file.\n2. **Queue.** The MP4 lands in `video/H3_upsampled` with the original soundtrack.\n\n### The node\n- **megapixels / denoise / lora / tile_tokens / redraw_seed**: as in the IMAGE workflow.\n- **structure_lock** (0 = off) holds faces, hands and line work to the clip; try 0.5-1. **lock_sigma** 1-1.5 also holds eyes and mouths on medium shots.\n- **off_24_audio**: H3 runs on a 24 fps clock; for other rates `retime` keeps the re-draw's lip sync.\n- **frame_gen / codec / quality**: as in H3 Save Video. x2 doubles the frame rate (RTX + `nvidia-vfx`).\n- **conditioning** (optional): a CLIPTextEncode of the clip's look. Unwired = zeroed out."
   ]
  },
